1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
Haydovchilik guvohnomasi imtihoniga tayyorlanyapsizmi?

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:09,080
Kitob sotib olish ham, kursga borish ham shart emas. Hammasi telefoningizda va bepul.

3
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:17,080
Ming ikki yuz qirqta original savol, oltmish ikkita bilet. Belgi, chiziq va chorraha bo'yicha rasmli savollar ham bor.

4
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:23,120
Imtihon rejimi haqiqiysiga o'xshatilgan: yigirma savol, yigirma besh daqiqa, ikkitagacha xatoga ruxsat.

5
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:30,000
Eng foydalisi — Xatolarim bo'limi. Noto'g'ri javob bergan savollaringiz to'planadi, aynan shular ustida ishlaysiz.

6
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,260
TartibOn. Telegramda qidiring.
